<title>USA: Dames &amp; Moore buys Salient 3 unit.</title>
<headline>Dames &amp; Moore buys Salient 3 unit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dames &amp; Moore Group Inc said Tuesday it had acquired SRA Technologies Inc, a subsidiary of Salient 3 Communications Inc, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>SRA is a professional services company providing specialized clinical laboratory services, contract research, analysis and management services to both government and commercial clients in the areas of life sciences, environment, and energy.</p>
<p>SRA was formed in 1975 and currently has revenues of about $19 million, Dames &amp; Moore said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
